---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Decision Intelligence with AI"
  description="A guided, interactive learning playbook that helps you use AI to frame decisions, assess evidence, diagnose causes, evaluate trade-offs and translate recommendations into action."
>

  <!-- ── Page header ─────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="page-header">
    <div class="wrap">
      <a href="/courses" class="back-link anim anim-1">&larr; All Courses</a>
      <p class="eyebrow anim anim-2">Executive Programme</p>
      <h1 class="page-header__h1 anim anim-3">
        Decision Intelligence with AI
      </h1>
      <p class="page-header__sub anim anim-4">
        From information to better decisions. A guided learning playbook that helps you
        use AI to frame decisions, assess evidence, diagnose causes, evaluate trade-offs
        and translate recommendations into action &mdash; one continuous case, six reusable
        templates, the right AI tool at each step.
      </p>
      <div class="page-header__meta anim anim-5">
        <span class="meta-chip">20 Micro-Lessons</span>
        <span class="meta-chip">6 Decision Templates</span>
        <span class="meta-chip">BeautyCo Case Study</span>
        <span class="meta-chip">Interactive Web Course</span>
      </div>
      <div class="page-header__cta anim anim-5">
        <a href="/decision-intelligence/di-home.html" class="btn btn--primary">Start the Interactive Course &rarr;</a>
        <a href="/decision-intelligence/di-beautyco.html" class="btn btn--ghost">Explore the BeautyCo Case</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <hr class="hr" />

  <!-- ── Who it's for ────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="section--sm">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="topic-grid">
        <div class="topic-meta">
          <p class="eyebrow">Overview</p>
        </div>
        <div class="topic-body">
          <p class="course__audience">
            <strong>Who it&rsquo;s for:</strong> Professionals and teams who want a practical,
            repeatable process for turning AI from an answer-generator into a genuine
            decision partner &mdash; no data science background required.
          </p>
          <p class="topic-lead" style="margin-top:var(--sp-5);">
            AI creates the most value when it helps you reason and challenge assumptions
            &mdash; not merely generate faster answers. This course combines short conceptual
            micro-lessons (Why &amp; What) with six hands-on decision templates (How), applied
            throughout to one continuous, realistic retail case: BeautyCo, a premium beauty
            retailer whose traffic is growing while conversion, satisfaction and repeat
            purchase decline.
          </p>

          <div class="info-card info-card--wide" style="margin-top:var(--sp-6);">
            <h3>What you&rsquo;ll learn</h3>
            <ul class="benefit-list">
              <li>Why more information doesn&rsquo;t automatically mean better decisions</li>
              <li>The Evidence &rarr; Reasoning &rarr; Judgement model, and the Guardrails that keep AI outputs trustworthy</li>
              <li>Context engineering with the RGCTO framework (Role, Goal, Context, Tasks, Output)</li>
              <li>Six reusable decision templates: Decision Framing, Situation Assessment, Root Cause Analysis, Evidence Validation, Options Assessment, and the Executive Action Plan</li>
              <li>When to reach for NotebookLM, ChatGPT/Gemini, Google Colab, Google Sheets or Nearpod &mdash; introduced exactly where each tool adds value, never all at once</li>
              <li>A continuous, realistic case &mdash; BeautyCo &mdash; carried from CEO problem to 90-day action plan</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <hr class="hr" />

  <!-- ── Course structure ────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="section--sm">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="topic-grid">
        <div class="topic-meta">
          <p class="eyebrow">Structure</p>
        </div>
        <div class="topic-body">
          <h2 class="topic-h2">Five interactive modules</h2>
          <p class="topic-lead">Each module is a self-paced, printable slide deck with quick checks, interactive prompt-builders and a knowledge-check quiz.</p>

          <div class="module-list">
            <a href="/decision-intelligence/di-why.html" class="module-card">
              <span class="module-num">1</span>
              <div>
                <h3>Why Decision Intelligence?</h3>
                <p>9 micro-lessons on the decision gap, and how AI shifts from information partner to thinking partner.</p>
              </div>
            </a>
            <a href="/decision-intelligence/di-what.html" class="module-card">
              <span class="module-num">2</span>
              <div>
                <h3>What Makes AI Decision-Ready?</h3>
                <p>11 micro-lessons covering Evidence/Reasoning/Judgement, Guardrails, RGCTO and the Discover&ndash;Diagnose&ndash;Decide &amp; Deliver lifecycle.</p>
              </div>
            </a>
            <a href="/decision-intelligence/di-how.html" class="module-card">
              <span class="module-num">3</span>
              <div>
                <h3>The Decision Journey</h3>
                <p>All six decision templates applied to BeautyCo &mdash; each with the evidence, a copyable prompt, the right AI tool, and a reflection question.</p>
              </div>
            </a>
            <a href="/decision-intelligence/di-beautyco.html" class="module-card">
              <span class="module-num">4</span>
              <div>
                <h3>BeautyCo Case Hub</h3>
                <p>The continuous case running through every template &mdash; background, performance dashboard, operations, customer voice, external intelligence, and your outputs.</p>
              </div>
            </a>
            <a href="/decision-intelligence/di-playground.html" class="module-card">
              <span class="module-num">5</span>
              <div>
                <h3>AI Playground</h3>
                <p>Every tool used in the course &mdash; NotebookLM, ChatGPT, Gemini, Colab, Sheets, Nearpod &mdash; each answering one question: when should I use this?</p>
              </div>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── CTA ─────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="section--sm not-sure" style="background:var(--surface);border-top:1px solid var(--border);">
    <div class="wrap not-sure__inner">
      <div>
        <h2>Ready to start?</h2>
        <p>The course is free to explore &mdash; start with Module 1 or dive straight into the BeautyCo case.</p>
      </div>
      <a href="/decision-intelligence/di-home.html" class="btn btn--primary">Start the Interactive Course &rarr;</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</Base>

<style>
  .page-header {
    padding: var(--sp-10) 0 var(--sp-7);
    background: var(--surface);
  }
  .back-link {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--accent);
    display: inline-block;
    margin-bottom: var(--sp-4);
    transition: color var(--ease);
  }
  .back-link:hover { color: var(--accent-dark); }
  .page-header__h1 {
    font-size: clamp(36px, 4.5vw, 58px);
    margin-top: var(--sp-3);
    letter-spacing: -.02em;
  }
  .page-header__sub {
    font-size: 20px;
    color: var(--text-2);
    margin-top: var(--sp-4);
    max-width: 68ch;
  }
  .page-header__meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--sp-2);
    margin-top: var(--sp-5);
  }
  .meta-chip {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--accent);
    background: var(--accent-light);
    padding: 6px 14px;
    border-radius: 100px;
    letter-spacing: .02em;
  }
  .page-header__cta {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--sp-3);
    margin-top: var(--sp-6);
  }
  .btn--ghost {
    background: none;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .btn--ghost:hover { border-color: var(--text-3); background: var(--surface-alt); }

  .topic-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 180px 1fr;
    gap: var(--sp-8);
    align-items: start;
  }
  .topic-meta { position: sticky; top: calc(68px + var(--sp-5)); }
  .topic-h2 {
    font-size: clamp(26px, 3vw, 36px);
    letter-spacing: -.01em;
    margin-bottom: var(--sp-3);
  }
  .topic-lead {
    font-size: 18px;
    color: var(--text-2);
    line-height: 1.8;
    max-width: 60ch;
  }

  .course__audience {
    font-size: 17px;
    color: var(--text-2);
    padding: var(--sp-4);
    background: var(--surface);
    border-radius: var(--r);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
  }
  .course__audience strong { color: var(--text); }

  .info-card {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: var(--sp-5);
  }
  .info-card--wide { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
  .info-card h3 {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: var(--sp-3);
  }
  .benefit-list { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--sp-3); }
  .benefit-list li {
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--text-2);
    line-height: 1.6;
    padding-left: 20px;
    position: relative;
  }
  .benefit-list li::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0; top: 8px;
    width: 6px; height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--accent);
  }

  .module-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--sp-4); margin-top: var(--sp-6); }
  .module-card {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--sp-5);
    align-items: flex-start;
    padding: var(--sp-5);
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    transition: all var(--ease);
  }
  .module-card:hover { border-color: var(--accent); transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .module-num {
    width: 40px; height: 40px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--accent);
    color: white;
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 18px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .module-card h3 { font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: var(--sp-2); }
  .module-card p { font-size: 15px; color: var(--text-2); line-height: 1.6; }

  .not-sure__inner {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--sp-6);
  }
  .not-sure h2 { font-size: 28px; }
  .not-sure p  { font-size: 18px; color: var(--text-2); margin-top: var(--sp-2); }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .topic-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: var(--sp-4); }
    .topic-meta { position: static; }
    .module-card { flex-direction: column; }
    .not-sure__inner { flex-direction: column; text-align: center; align-items: flex-start; }
  }
</style>
